	(text "P-FET high-side switch: 100k gate pull-up holds it off; the 2N7002 pulls the gate down through 10k with 100n gate-source, ~1 ms ramp so the drive's bulk caps do not trip the fuse. BAY_EN pull-down keeps the bay off through boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 276 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
